                "markdown": "Do not schedule a file a less privileged user can rewrite\n\n- Change the observed operation at Dockerfile:50: root runs cd /app \u0026\u0026 bash bin/script\n- Remediate established vulnerabilities and poor practice. For Review items, resolve the named evidence before deciding whether or how behavior needs to change.\n- Run the scheduled command as the user that owns the file, or make that file writable only by the schedule user.\n",
                "text": "Do not schedule a file a less privileged user can rewrite. Change the observed operation at Dockerfile:50: root runs cd /app \u0026\u0026 bash bin/script Remediate established vulnerabilities and poor practice. For Review items, resolve the named evidence before deciding whether or how behavior needs to change. Run the scheduled command as the user that owns the file, or make that file writable only by the schedule user."
              },
